% Problem 3. Chace vol. II pl. 35 (photograph X, register 4; photograph IX, N.Y. Historical Society fragments), PDF pp. 117-118; Peet p. 52 (pl. F).
No. 3
"{The making of loaves 6 for} man [10]."
Multiply ['2] '10 by 10.     % "Make thou the multiplication: ['2] '10 times 10."
"The doing as [it occurs]:"
  [1]   ['2] '10
\ [2]   [1] '5               % tick restored (Chace "[\2"; Peet the same); Chace fn 3: faint fractional dot on 5
  [4]   [2] '3 '15
\ 8     4 [2/3 '10] 30       % 30 for '30; Chace fn 4: "The scribe omitted the fractional dot."
Total 6.
"the same, this is."
